This repository is the public lab template for AIDD-MS-0 (SQL Foundations). It is
public so students can launch it via "Use this template" / GitHub Codespaces, but
the course materials remain proprietary. The lab database image it references
bundles Microsoft SQL Server (Developer edition) and the Microsoft AdventureWorks
sample databases under Microsoft's own license terms (free for development and
test use).
